BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_47d6d122-ffd0-4d06-afc0-cc34e6796a0b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
